  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 788 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D13"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA lists potassium chloride as To Be Discontinued with an initial posting date of 2021-11-02.",
      "cites": ["D19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection of Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited ended 2019-09-06 and was classified OAI, with a classification letter dated 2020-05-25, 788 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited on 2020-03-25, 587 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter Healthcare Corporation's plant (FEI 2618677) received multiple OAI classifications between 2010 and 2016, with the most recent prior to posting ending 2016-10-03.",
      "cites": ["E37"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter's plant (FEI 1416980) received an OAI classification ending 2024-08-01 and another ending 2026-04-02, both after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E17", "E19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira, Inc.'s plant (FEI 1021343) received OAI classifications in 2010 and 2011, with a Warning Letter issued 2010-04-12.",
      "cites": ["E49", "E51", "E58"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 31 bags of 29.8 g/1000 mL, 50 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would increase Corvale East's supply from 2.7 to 5 days while Corvale General retains 16 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D20"]
    }
  ]
}
